{"id":"n72193-1-12","stage":5,"title":"일광욕 · 日光浴","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n72193-1-12-1","ko":"올 여름휴가는 어디로 가요?","zh":"今年夏季休假去哪里？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"올","meaning":"今年","explanation":"올：今年","readings":[{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22072","senseId":"1","lemma":"올","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"올","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3"}},{"text":"여름휴가는","meaning":"暑假，暑期休假","explanation":"여름휴가：暑假，暑期休假；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"여름휴가","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22667","senseId":"1","lemma":"여름휴가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"여름휴가는","audio":"/audio/30682426ca78c06c01d0.mp3"}},{"text":"어디로","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"1","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디로","audio":"/audio/0fbbfd5af1ab3c98e173.mp3"}},{"text":"가요?","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가요","audio":"/audio/f56d0f13cacc6a44dd26.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d4e5ba0f9d89e827","term":"올","zh":"今年","audio":"/audio/d4e5ba0f9d89e82785b6.mp3","entryId":"22072","definition":"现在正在度过的年。","pronunciation":["올"]},{"id":"2f326418aa384e84","term":"여름휴가","zh":"暑假，暑期休假","audio":"/audio/2f326418aa384e842b6e.mp3","entryId":"22667","definition":"在夏季上学或上班的人在一定期间休息。","pronunciation":["여름휴가"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不知道的处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가